## 📈 Model Evaluation

We intend to evaluate the recommendation models using appropriate metrics, including:

- RMSE (Root Mean Squared Error).
- MAE (Mean Absolute Error).
- Precision@K.
- Recall@K.
- Recommendation diversity.

The objective is not just to predict ratings accurately but also to recommend books that users genuinely find interesting.

